{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, move to it, check properties, take it, do specific task, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
